{
  "comment": [
    "Regeneration (feature 0004 T13). The runner reads one vector per file (ADR 0045, id <path>#0), so each entry's 'file' member names its output under conformance/vectors/jwt/nested/; it is not a vector member and is dropped when splitting.",
    "1. node conformance/tools/jwt-oracle/gen.mjs conformance/tools/jwt-oracle/specs/nested.json <tmp>/nested.json",
    "2. node -e 'const fs=require(\"fs\");const o=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(process.argv[1]));for(const v of o.vectors){const f=v.file;delete v.file;fs.writeFileSync(\"conformance/vectors/jwt/nested/\"+f,JSON.stringify(v,null,2)+\"\\n\")}' <tmp>/nested.json",
    "Every JWE (the CEK, IV and ECDH ephemeral key) and every ES256 signature is randomized, so a re-run rewrites every token with different, equally valid bytes: regenerate only on purpose. The two jwt.issue entries build no token and pass through with their key names resolved.",
    "Expected verdicts are written by hand here (the oracle never decides them). The RFC 7520 §6 and RFC 7519 App. A vectors are not from this spec: see conformance/vectors/jwt/rfc7520-nested/README.md."
  ],
  "vectors": [
    {
      "file": "es256-dir-a256gcm.json",
      "source": "RFC 7519 §5.2, §7.2, §11.2; RFC 7518 §4.5",
      "description": "Nested JWT, sign-then-encrypt: an ES256 inner JWS in a dir + A256GCM compact JWE (cty JWT) under a 256-bit oct key, with separate JWE and JWS allow-lists (RFC 8725 §3.3): valid, with the exact inner claims and the inner alg (ADR 0027 §7)",
      "operation": "jwt.validate",
      "input": {
        "token": "$token",
        "now": 1300819320,
        "allowed_algs": [
          "ES256"
        ],
        "key": {
          "$public": "p256"
        },
        "decrypt": {
          "key": {
            "$key": "oct-32"
          },
          "allowed_algs": [
            "dir"
          ],
          "allowed_enc": [
            "A256GCM"
          ]
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "claims": {
          "iss": "https://issuer.example",
          "sub": "alice",
          "iat": 1300819200,
          "exp": 1300819380
        },
        "alg": "ES256"
      },
      "jws": {
        "header": {
          "alg": "ES256",
          "typ": "JWT"
        },
        "payload": "{\"iss\":\"https://issuer.example\",\"sub\":\"alice\",\"iat\":1300819200,\"exp\":1300819380}",
        "key": "p256"
      },
      "jwe": {
        "alg": "dir",
        "enc": "A256GCM",
        "key": "oct-32"
      }
    },
